# graphify knowledge-graph build excludes.
# Vendored third-party libraries (minified bundles: vega, vega-lite, vega-embed,
# mermaid, htmx). They are not project code — parsing their minified sources adds
# ~2,500 single-letter-function nodes that swamp the graph and bury the actual
# codebase in the report's god-nodes / suggested-questions. Excluded from every
# graphify run (detection auto-loads this file).
src/episteme/web/static/vendor/

# Any minified bundle, anywhere (e.g. static/htmx.min.js). Minified == vendored;
# authored scripts like static/post.js are not matched.
*.min.js
